1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,708
(Howard:)All right, if you're gonna
calmly make excellent points,

2
00:00:02,707 --> 00:00:04,777
(Howard:)then I don't know
if I want to talk to you.

3
00:00:08,212 --> 00:00:09,812
(Howard:)Okay. I get it.

4
00:00:09,814 --> 00:00:11,844
(Howard:)And it's sweet that
you're worried about me,

5
00:00:11,849 --> 00:00:14,179
(Howard:)but I can take care of myself.

6
00:00:14,185 --> 00:00:16,785
(Bernadette:)I'm not worried about you.
I'm worried about me.

7
00:00:16,787 --> 00:00:19,287
(Bernadette:)I don't want to go through
this pregnancy listening

8
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,860
(Bernadette:)to you complain about Sheldon
driving you crazy

9
00:00:21,859 --> 00:00:22,929
(Bernadette:)more than you already do.

10
00:00:22,927 --> 00:00:27,497
(Howard:)Here we go with
the ironclad logic again.

11
00:00:27,498 --> 00:00:30,228
(Bernadette:)You've tried to work
with him before.

12
00:00:30,234 --> 00:00:31,504
(Bernadette:)It hasn't gone well.

13
00:00:31,502 --> 00:00:34,002
(Bernadette:)Why is this time
gonna be any different?

14
00:00:34,005 --> 00:00:36,105
Is the fetus helping you?

15
00:00:36,107 --> 00:00:37,977
'Cause that's cheating.

16
00:00:40,711 --> 00:00:42,981
(Raj:)(phone rings)

17
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,050
(Raj:)Hello?
CLAIRE: Hey, Raj.

18
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:46,419
(Claire:)It's Claire. How are you?

19
00:00:46,417 --> 00:00:48,487
(Raj:)Hi. I'm good. Really good.

20
00:00:48,486 --> 00:00:50,556
(Raj:)Well, I don't know
why I said “really good.”

21
00:00:50,554 --> 00:00:51,824
(Raj:)I'm just regular good.

22
00:00:51,822 --> 00:00:53,152
(Raj:)I really just wanted
to sound confident.

23
00:00:53,157 --> 00:00:54,787
And that “really”
was a real “really,”

24
00:00:54,792 --> 00:00:58,392
not a fake “really”
like the first “really.”

25
00:00:58,396 --> 00:00:59,626
(Claire:)Really?

